{"id": "1540045768021381130", "channel_id": "1326453691527594035", "author_id": "332573289438380032", "author_name": "moyashi0672", "content": "- You also don't have many draw cards capabilities so you need perfect RNG", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T17:12:03.763000+00:00", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-20T17:18:11.227000+00:00"}
{"id": "1540046169173131336", "channel_id": "1326453691527594035", "author_id": "332573289438380032", "author_name": "moyashi0672", "content": "- The reason i'm saying all of this is because stuffs like : you get 3 stagnations debuffs = you can't properly play your cards at all, you rely on 4 cost drawn early so you can reduce it through prepare effects", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T17:13:39.405000+00:00", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-20T17:18:30.047000+00:00"}
