{"id": "1540046567120175255", "channel_id": "1326453691527594035", "author_id": "332573289438380032", "author_name": "moyashi0672", "content": "- If the enemy para you then they can actually win against you because your max STR gain with this team is only 16 STR, we can say 19 STR if you kill with exalt but at the end of the day you won't have much cards to play if you get para", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T17:15:14.283000+00:00", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-20T17:17:49.952000+00:00"}
