{"id": "1540047012177645680", "channel_id": "1326453691527594035", "author_id": "332573289438380032", "author_name": "moyashi0672", "content": "- You can kill early someone with feast of decay posse to reduce the amount of draws you have to do but reciprocally they can just snipe your glotan and you'll be a goner because you have 1 turn wait tempo", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T17:17:00.393000+00:00", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-20T21:10:36.978000+00:00"}
